    "title": "Rep. Moore: Trump's Strength Leads to 'Monumental' Step in NATO Agreement to Increase Defense Spending | NTD",
    "text": "Rep. Blake Moore (R-Utah) discussed with NTD's Steve Lance about President Donald Trump's \"big, beautiful bill,\" and the president's show of strength in achieving agreement from NATO states to increase their defense spending from 2 percent of GDP to 5 percent by 2035. Moore also discussed the U.S. military's successful strikes against Iranian nuclear sites on Saturday.\nRep. Moore: Trump's Strength Leads to 'Monumental' Step in NATO Agreement to Increase Defense Spending\nRep. Blake Moore (R-Utah) discussed the 'big, beautiful bill' and the agreement from NATO states to increase their defense spending.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 6/25/2025, 11:46:34 PM EDT",
